OL,4,B'The world got to see today' - who is  
OL,5,Bnew Spurs star Williams-Barnett?       
OL,6,GLuca Williams-Barnett's performance in 
OL,7,Ghis first Premier League start was     
OL,8,Gthat good it had two of his Tottenham  
OL,9,Gteam-mates labelling him "incredible". 
OL,11,FThe 18-year-old winger delivered the   
OL,12,Fopener with his first senior goal and  
OL,13,Fthen played a pivotal role in Dominic  
OL,14,FSolanke's second as Spurs comfortably  
OL,15,Fbeat Ipswich 2-0 at home.              
OL,17,FAs full debuts go, it does not get     
OL,18,Fmuch better than that.                 
